            "review_title": "Review at Cuon Papa's",
            "review_text": "Claire M\nWinnipeg, Canada79 contributions\n0\nA Hidden Gem!\nMar 2020\nThis small restaurant was recommended to me by a local- that in itself should be a good sign! It is fabulous and so inexpensive. The menu has a lot of pictures and some of the items are designed for 2 people. If you like salad rolls, then this is the place for you. I have been in Nha Trang for 5 weeks and these were my favourite salad rolls. The menu includes a variety of different kinds of roles. You won’t regret eating here!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 4, 2020",
