            "review_title": "Review at Cuon Papa's",
            "review_text": "palawanismyhome\nPalawan Island, Philippines24281 contributions\n0\nTry the fresh spring rolls\nNov 2019\nBefore i reached Nha Trang i researched where i could eat the fresh spring rolls (goi cuon in Vietnamese) and was delighted that this restaurant was only a 5 minute walk from our guest house. There was a menu, but no English one available, but however there were photos of the meals. I immediately selected two plates of Goi Cuon while my wife chose fried rice. When the food arrived (very quickly) it was not long before i finished the two plates and they were really delicious. I found out later that they were very cheap too, as they were double money in HCMC. The staff spoke some English and service was fast.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 4, 2019",
